[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1386038896","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784#issuecomment-1386038896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784","id":1386038896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85SnUZw","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-17T20:55:04Z","updated_at":"2023-01-17T20:55:04Z","body":"This exists and has been determined to be \"allowed\" for Fedora","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1386038896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405077369","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784#issuecomment-1405077369","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784","id":1405077369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Tv8d5","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-26T14:24:03Z","updated_at":"2023-01-26T14:24:03Z","body":"+1 to add as an exception. This follows the pattern of many other exceptions on the exceptions list, just using a different technical \"trigger\" for the exception to apply.\r\n\r\nFor naming -- @Rombobeorn As far as you're aware, does it look like this exception originated with GNAT? If so, I'd be inclined to use the ID `GNAT-exception` since that follows the pattern that is _generally_ used on the [Exceptions list](https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html). Or if it's more tied to another component (GNARL / FLORIST / AdaCore), any of those would work -- I'm just not familiar with the pieces of these Ada tools so I'm kind of guessing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405077369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1406668117","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784#issuecomment-1406668117","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784","id":1406668117,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85T2A1V","user":{"login":"Rombobeorn","id":7755151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTUxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7755151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Rombobeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-27T15:36:32Z","updated_at":"2023-01-27T15:36:32Z","body":"\"GNAT-exception\" works for me, although I don't believe it was ever used in the compiler itself, but rather in its library. The exception is written for libraries after all.\r\n\r\nSome background might help you understand what you're deciding on. GNAT was originally a fork of GCC modified to compile Ada. It was merged back around the time when the GNU C Compiler transformed into the GNU Compiler Collection, so now GNAT is the Ada front-end of GCC.\r\n\r\nWith the compiler come a standard library and a runtime library, which are often treated together as Libgnat. (The name suggests that GNARL or Libgnarl is the part that is considered the runtime library.) This, I believe, is where this license exception originated.\r\n\r\nA bunch of helper programs are also included with the GCC source code: Gnatmake, Gnatbind, Gnatlink, Gnatprep, Gnatclean and more. A wrapper program called \"gnat\" allows you to call those as \"gnat make\", \"gnat bind\" and so on. Those don't have this exception as they aren't libraries.\r\n\r\nDevelopment of GNAT continued in the company Ada Core Technologies, later Adacore. They have added many new libraries and tools. Some of their names contain \"GNAT\". Others don't. They habitually used this exception in their libraries until they started switching from GPL 2 to GPL 3.\r\n\r\nNowadays you'll find names containing \"GNAT\" all over Adacore's website. GNAT Studio is an IDE. Gnatbench is a plugin for Eclipse. Gnatcoll is a sprawling collection of libraries. These and GCC, GDB and several other tools and libraries are bundled and sold as GNAT Pro. Adacore's customers can log in to GNAT Tracker, which I guess is something like an issue tracker for support requests.\r\n\r\nThus \"GNAT\" is a little unspecific, but that's rather fitting as this exception was historically used for several libraries from Adacore.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1406668117/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1419905960","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784#issuecomment-1419905960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1784","id":1419905960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Uoguo","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","